---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="container about-inner">
    <div class="side" data-reveal>
      <SectionHeading index="01" title="About" />
    </div>
    <div class="body" data-reveal-group>
      <p>
        I sit where engineering meets the customer. I started with LLM fine-tuning at AMD, then ran production EKS
        clusters on AWS with Terraform, Helm and ArgoCD. Today I architect AI solutions end to end: I turn a client's
        requirements into a sized, costed design, write the proposal, and see it through delivery.
      </p>
      <p>
        I've worked with universities and enterprises and supported defence and government tenders, on everything from
        coding-agent platforms to multi-node GPU clusters. I care about designs that are right-sized, explainable and
        ready to build.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 56px 0 64px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .about-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 20px 64px;
  }
  .side {
    flex: 0 0 220px;
  }
  .body {
    flex: 1 1 480px;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 18px);
  }
  .body p {
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
